Summary of the changes made to Python (the PSF License Version 2, clause 3):
the modules and objects listed below were translated from CPython's Python and
C sources to C++ and adapted to the neos Python runtime's object model (their
classes are made of native functions, their objects are the runtime's); their
behaviour, messages and documentation strings are CPython's. Each file's header
names the CPython sources it is derived from.

